    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d545">

                <pb facs="0601" n="489" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg489"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Pierrepont to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-07-19"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 19,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Department’s July 18. At the request of the Chilean minister for foreign affairs
                    1 to-day handed to him a copy of the protocol. The Argentine and Brazilian
                    ministers not yet having instructions, I ventured the private opinion that he
                    could exercise a very salutary influence on Ecuador. This brought forth the
                    renewed assurance of cooperation and of desire to promote peace.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pierrepont.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
